oing people?\"","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"6:48","t":"And We send not the messengers except as bringers of good tidings and warners. So whoever believes and reforms - there will be no fear concerning them, nor will they grieve.","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"6:49","t":"But those who deny Our verses - the punishment will touch them for their defiant disobedience.","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"6:50","t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"I do not tell you that I have the depositories [containing the provision] of Allāh or that I know the unseen, nor do I tell you that I am an angel. I only follow what is revealed to me.\" Say, \"Is the blind equivalent to the seeing? Then will you not give thought?\"","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"6:51","t":"And warn by it [i.e., the Qur’ān] those who fear that they will be gathered before their Lord - for them besides Him will be no protector and no intercessor - that they might become righteous.","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":51,"sd":null},{"k":"6:52","t":"And do not send away those who call upon their Lord morning and afternoon, seeking His face [i.e., favor]. Not upon you is anything of their account and not upon them is anything of your account. So were you to send them away, you would [then] be of the wrongdoers.","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":52,"sd":null}],"juz":7,"hizb":14,"surahs":[6],"sajdah":false}